     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">So something where you just affect the width isn&#39;t helpful? <div><br></div><div><a href=\"http://docs.ggplot2.org/current/geom_histogram.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://docs.ggplot2.org/current/geom_histogram.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792367701420000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1UKlZmexPkdvJWq0fyNxAz\">http://docs.ggplot2.org/current/geom_histogram.html</a><br></div><div><br></div><div>You just want lines where the bars would be? </div><div><br></div><div>[Ben&#39;s email]</div><div><a href=\"http://stackoverflow.com/questions/25952270/code-for-type-h-in-ggplot2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://stackoverflow.com/questions/25952270/code-for-type-h-in-ggplot2&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792367701420000&amp;usg=AOvVaw12jvDR320OMwz0mcnO92FS\">http://stackoverflow.com/questions/25952270/code-for-type-h-in-ggplot2</a><br></div><div><a href=\"http://stackoverflow.com/questions/26139878/needle-plot-in-ggplot2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://stackoverflow.com/questions/26139878/needle-plot-in-ggplot2&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792367701420000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3hHmF_oGiMx0CsGuTe4Zxy\">http://stackoverflow.com/questions/26139878/needle-plot-in-ggplot2</a> (linerange implementation)<br></div><div><br></div><div>There&#39;s also geom_lollipop</div><div><a href=\"https://rud.is/b/2016/04/07/geom_lollipop-by-the-chartettes/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://rud.is/b/2016/04/07/geom_lollipop-by-the-chartettes/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792367701420000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0YDLWEiGy9fHhrrVJJ7mQK\">https://rud.is/b/2016/04/07/geom_lollipop-by-the-chartettes/</a><br></div><div>But I&#39;m not sure if it plays nice with a histogram. </div><div><br></div><div>B</div></div><div